@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram
hide footbox
actor User
participant System

User -> System : 1. Submits recycling details (sack quantities, EcoPoint)
System -> System: 1.1 Validates input data

alt Data is valid : True
System -> System : 1.2 Saves RecyclingRecord
System -> System : 1.3 Executes UC5 (Earn Points)
System -> System : 1.4 Evaluates UC6 (Unlock Badge)
System --> User : return success

else Data is valid : False
System --> User : return failure
end


 @enduml